<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Goodman half year profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Goodman half year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				  55.8  vs  45.9</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 89.3  vs  83.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		  3.0  vs  2.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Goodman Fielder Ltd is a bakery and food processing group.  </p>
<p>    Sales (billion)		   2.06 vs  2.08</p>
<p>    Other income			65.9 vs  16.7</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			  4.5 vs  3.8</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		loss 5.1 vs  loss 7.0</p>
<p>Dividend is unfranked</p>
<p>Pay date April 29</p>
<p>Reg date April 4</p>
<p>    Tax				    27.0 vs  31.3</p>
<p>    Interest			     36.2 vs  40.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 68.4 vs  72.8</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
